  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1706965326_5374361_d35939cd9fd5ca72e925e9ddbe97b33d.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>We, JUNZEN, are a new microbrand of wristwatches from Japan. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Our watches are characterized by beautifully polished cases crafted by artisans and dials that eliminate unnecessary decorations.&nbsp;<br></span><span>With a touch of playfulness, we have applied a fum&eacute; finish to the blue dials. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>These are versatile automatic dress watches suitable for a variety of occasions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>98% of the watch body, excluding the strap, made in Japan. This is quite rare for this price range and is a result of our desire to prevent the decline of Japan's small and medium-sized watch manufacturing industry.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>The case of the JUNZEN00 is made from SUS316L stainless steel, which is resistant to rust and can be recycled even after decades of use.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>We use DHL GoGreen Plus service as part of our commitment to aiming towards climate-neutral shipping.</span></p>",
